TOOL_CALL: ap_show_showcase {"tiles":[{"title":"Build me an AI agent that handles my work","description":"A persistent AI worker with its own tools — reasons, decides, and acts on your behalf so you don't have to.","icon":"bot"},{"title":"Automate my repetitive tasks end-to-end","description":"Tell me the chore and I'll wire it up so it runs itself — triggered, scheduled, or on demand.","icon":"workflow"},{"title":"Do a one-time task for me right now","description":"Hand me something concrete — emails to send, leads to enrich, data to clean — and I'll do it on the spot.","icon":"zap"},{"title":"Connect my apps and keep them in sync","description":"I'll bridge hundreds of tools so data flows automatically between them without you touching a thing.","icon":"waypoints"}]}
TOOL_RESULT: {"displayed":true}
ASSISTANT: I love the ambition — let's make that happen. I can build you an AI agent that takes over an entire role, automate the stuff you do on repeat, or just handle a concrete task right now.

What's the job you most want off your plate?
ASSISTANT: What's the job you most want off your plate? The more you tell me about your work — your role, the tools you use, what eats up your time — the better I can build something that actually replaces you on it.
ASSISTANT: What do you do day-to-day? Even a rough description — "I manage customer emails," "I chase leads in my CRM," "I schedule and report on social media" — gives me enough to build something real. I'll take it from there.
